  "content": {
    "equation": "Bolus Dose:\nWhen Bolus Dose is \"yes\":\nWhen Bolus Dose is \"yes\":\nBolus Dose (mg) = Weight * Bolus Dose\n• Bolus Dose (mg) is calculated in mg\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Bolus Dose is input in mg/kg\nBolus Dose (mL) = (Weight * Bolus Dose) / Infusion Concentration\n• Bolus Dose (mL) is calculated in mL\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Bolus Dose is input in mg/kg\n• Infusion Concentration is input in mg/mL\nInfusion Dose:\nInfusion Dose (mg/hr) = Weight * Infusion Dose\n• Infusion Dose (mg/hr) is calculated in mg/hr\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Infusion Dose is input in mg/kg/hr\nInfusion Dose (mL/hr) = (Weight * Infusion Dose) / Infusion Concentration\n• Infusion Dose (mL/hr) is calculated in mL/hr\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Infusion Dose is input in mg/kg/hr\n• Infusion Concentration is input in mg/mL",
